      "executeOnce": false,
      "id": "52135877-5727-4033-9178-8021c9cd19e5",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "parameters": {
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "ROLE:\nYou are the CPC Tool AI Extraction Agent processing ONE case at a time.\n\nCONTEXT:\nYou receive:\n1. full_agenda_text (for reference context)\n2. case_items object containing:\n   - item_number\n   - raw_text\n   - attachments[]\n\nTASK:\n- Extract fields ONLY from the case_items.raw_text and case_items.attachments\n- Do NOT process multiple cases\n- Do NOT invent information\n- Return null for missing fields\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n- Return ONE JSON object (not array)\n- Include ALL fields\n- Valid JSON only"
